# SportsBook architecture

Badminton/sports court reservation app for Colombo, Sri Lanka. Flutter (Dart), clean and modular.

## Layout

```
lib/features/auth/        # Splash, Auth, Profile, Wallet
lib/features/discovery/   # Dashboard, Search, Filters, Empty State
lib/features/booking/     # 4-step checkout, Turnstile QR, Fault Report
lib/features/partners/    # Matchmaker Beacon, Bookings, Reschedule, Reviews
lib/core/                 # Theme, navigation, shared models, mock database
```

## Rules

- Put screens, widgets, and feature state under the matching `lib/features/<name>/` folder. Do not dump screens in `lib/` root.
- Shared types, theme, routing, and mock DB live in `lib/core/` only.
- Keep features independent: import other features only through `lib/core` contracts when needed.
- Prefer small files: one screen or one service per file.

```dart
// ❌ BAD
lib/screens/checkout.dart

// ✅ GOOD
lib/features/booking/checkout/checkout_screen.dart
```
